recommend keep-going — the Monocypher-parity primitive set is complete; the next Season G crux is composition (a Kumara-facing signed/keyed carry over the GREEN primitives) or a streaming SHA-512 for unbounded messages, each its own non-gated round; signing/keying with the maintainer's own identity key stays the custody gate.
